<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam Sept inflation up 0.3 pct, 2.9 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 13:13 GMT 25/9]</title>
<headline>Vietnam Sept inflation up 0.3 pct, 2.9 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 13:13 GMT 25/9]</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's General Statistics Office issued the following economic indicators on Tuesday:</p>
<p> VIETNAM CONSUMER PRICES:	   Sept 96    Aug 96     Sept 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change		+0.3	 -0.4	 +0.5</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		  +2.9	 +3.2	+17.1</p>
<p>    Index (base 100 = prev. Dec)    102.5	102.2	112.2</p>
<p>(Corrects Sept 96 Month-on-month figure from +0.8)</p>
</text>
